    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and well-maintained three-bedroom mid-terrace family home to the market ideally positioned on the ever-popular Greencastle Road, Clonshaugh, Dublin 17. No. 186 is situated in a mature and established residential setting and offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike seeking a home in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe location is second to none with a wealth of amenities close by including Coolock Retail Park, Northside Shopping Centre, schools, parks, sports facilities and Beaumont Hospital. Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre, the M1 and M50 motorways are all easily accessible, while the area is well serviced by excellent public transport links.\n\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation of c. 70 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge, fully fitted kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms and a main family bathroom.\n\nNo. 186 comes to the market in good condition throughout and benefits from gas fired central heating, fitted kitchen units, built-in storage and bright spacious living accommodation. To the rear lies a large low-maintenance paved garden with storage shed offering excellent outdoor space ideal for entertaining or relaxing. To the front is a mature garden with a driveway and ample parking available nearby.\n\nThis property is sure to generate strong interest from a wide variety of buyers and early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• c. 70 sq.m\n• BER E2\n• 3 Bed / 1 Bath mid terrace home\n• Built in the 1960's\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Bright and spacious living accommodation\n• Fully fitted modern kitchen\n• Large low maintenance rear garden\n• Storage shed to rear\n• Mature front garden\n• Ample parking available\n• Vacant possession\n• Mature and established residential area\n• Close to Coolock Retail Park and Northside Shopping Centre\n• Easy access to M1, M50 and Dublin Airport\n• Excellent transport links nearby\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers & investors\n• Viewing highly advised\n"
      },
      {
